# No git-LFS. Model weights live on the Hugging Face Hub and are fetched by
# SHA-256-verified download driven by registry/*.yaml — never committed here
# (putting ~1 GB of ONNX in LFS would bill clone bandwidth against a GitHub LFS
# quota on a public repo; see the fork plan §5 and docs/methodology.md).
#
# The only committed binaries are small: PR-curve figures (~100 KB) and tiny test
# fixtures. They are stored as ordinary git blobs; the pre-commit large-file hook
# (2 MB cap) is the backstop against anything big slipping in. Routing *.png
# through LFS without LFS enabled server-side produced broken pointer files in CI,
# so it was removed.

# Keep line endings sane for text we do track.
*.md       text
*.yaml     text
*.yml      text
*.toml     text
*.py       text
